cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproducibility package, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Tett på transition pathways reproducibility package"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, aggregate result tables, model diagnostics and publication
  figures for a study of administrative transition pathways from early
  intervention to formal expert assessment in Trondheim Educational
  Psychological Service (2023-2025). The restricted person-level source records
  are not included; see docs/DATA_ACCESS.md.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Lillebø"
    given-names: "Otto Sevaldson"
    email: "otto.lillebo@nifu.no"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8952-3948"
    affiliation: "Nordic Institute for Studies in Innovation, Research and Education (NIFU)"
keywords:
  - educational psychological service
  - early intervention
  - expert assessment
  - administrative data
  - survival analysis
date-released: 2026-11-25
